{"ts": 0.043061, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J", "len": 11}
{"ts": 0.044703, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[93mshelltutor\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 4 · Commands and streams\u001b[0m \u001b[90m───────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 250}
{"ts": 0.044786, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n\u001b[1;97mStage 4: Commands and streams\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nSix short lessons, then a task. You'll read a command's parts, then\r\njoin commands together and send what they print into files.\r\nThis stage runs in its own folder, stage4, with a few files the tutor put\r\n", "len": 251}
{"ts": 0.044844, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "there; \u001b[92mpwd\u001b[0m shows it.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m for lesson 4.1.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 85}
{"ts": 0.048628, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mnext\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mprev\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 71}
